# Campus Life

Campus Life is a responsive student guide website created for the Web Technologies course.

## About the Project

The website helps students find useful information about:

- Study tips
- Campus resources
- Student activities
- Contact information

## Pages

- Home
- About Us
- Resources
- Contact

## Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- Flexbox
- CSS Grid
- Media Queries
- Bootstrap 5

## Features

- Responsive design for desktop, tablet, and mobile
- Bootstrap navigation bar
- Responsive grid layout
- Bootstrap buttons and cards
- Image carousel
- Responsive contact form
- JavaScript form validation, including practice password length and confirmation
- Animated FAQs and a subscription popup
- Background color switcher and live date/time
- Accessible semantic HTML

